Feature: The loop
  The league runs [[generation]]s, one after the other. In each generation, each
  [[strategy]] gives [[challenger]]s. The league plays them all, and promotes the best one that
  passes. It writes all of it in the folder `league`.

  There are three strategies. The evolution strategy (`es`) gives 8 challengers near a point
  of its own, at random. After each generation it moves the point to its two best challengers,
  also when none of them was promoted. Thus small gains add up until one challenger is clearly
  better than the champion. The Claude tuner
  (`claude-tuner`) reads the report of the last generation and gives new numbers, with its
  reasons. The Claude engineer (`claude-engineer`) changes the code of the executor or the
  tactics in a git worktree of its own.

  The league does not trust what a strategy says. It runs the tests of the executor on the
  code of each Claude engineer, and refuses code that fails them. It refuses code that changes
  the [[safety envelope]]. A promoted change to the code goes on the branch `league/champion`.
  The league never merges it into `master`.

  Expectation: Each generation is written down
    Given the league is new
    When the league runs one generation with the evolution strategy
    Then the challengers in the history are 8
    And the report of the generation is written
    And the champion file is written

  Expectation: The evolution strategy improves on a slow start
    Given the league is started from the slow executor
    When the league runs 5 generations with the evolution strategy
    Then the score of the champion against the slow executor is at least 0.05

  Expectation: A challenger whose tests fail stays out
    Given the league is new
    When a Claude strategy gives a challenger whose tests fail
    Then the verdict is refused
    And the reason is its tests fail

  Expectation: A challenger that changes the envelope stays out
    Given the league is new
    When a Claude strategy gives a challenger that changes the envelope
    Then the verdict is refused
    And the reason is it changes the envelope
